Rampsmith

Subprocessor changes
====================

From November 20, 2026, Rampsmith will change the companies that process
data on its behalf:

- Added: Example Mail Co, for transactional email (United States)
- Removed: Old Example Host, used for hosting (European Union)

To object to a change, write to support@rampsmith.example by November 13,
2026.

See the full subprocessor list:
https://rampsmith.example/legal/subprocessors

____________________________________________________________________________

You received this email because Rampsmith tells customers about subprocessor
changes at least 30 days ahead.

Questions? Write to support@rampsmith.example.

